# --- discern harness ---
# These are discern's generated agent files, materialized skills,
# and local provider state. discern manages these files for you,
# and refreshes them automatically, so you shouldn't edit this
# section by hand. A full list of discern-managed files is
# available in the docs: docs/80-development/install-surface.md
/AGENTS.md
/CLAUDE.md
/GEMINI.md
/.claude/*
!/.claude/settings.json
/.agents/skills/
# --- /discern harness ---
